WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.323
Unit fifteen. Sun Safety!

2
00:00:04.293 --> 00:00:07.939
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.989 --> 00:00:11.332
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.382 --> 00:00:14.827
Today we learn about Sun Safety. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:19.570
Sun. Say it with me. Sun!

6
00:00:23.053 --> 00:00:26.187
Hat. Say it with me. Hat!

7
00:00:29.685 --> 00:00:32.952
Shade. Say it with me. Shade!

8
00:00:36.456 --> 00:00:39.723
Water. Say it with me. Water!

9
00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:46.570
Hot. Say it with me. Hot!

10
00:00:50.073 --> 00:00:53.640
Skin. Say it with me. Skin!

11
00:00:57.137 --> 00:01:00.687
Sunscreen. Say it with me. Sunscreen!

12
00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:07.440
Cool. Say it with me. Cool!

13
00:01:10.941 --> 00:01:17.757
The sun can be very hot. I wear a hat and play in the shade. I drink water and put on sunscreen to protect my skin.

14
00:01:17.807 --> 00:01:19.003
I can do that too!

15
00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:25.719
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:25.769 --> 00:01:26.919
Shade!

17
00:01:27.807 --> 00:01:32.946
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:32.996 --> 00:01:34.146
Sunscreen!

19
00:01:35.174 --> 00:01:40.835
Did you know? A hat helps protect your face, ears and neck from the strong sun!

20
00:01:40.885 --> 00:01:42.946
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:43.637 --> 00:01:51.380
Think and answer. How can you stay cool on a hot day?

22
00:01:51.430 --> 00:01:52.580
Great answer!

23
00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:58.665
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:01:58.715 --> 00:02:01.332
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

